# Top-level packages of the development layer (Rust + C). Everything else in the layer is their
# dependency closure, resolved against the base image and pinned with checksums in dev.lock.
#   gcc       C compiler and driver (also the linker driver rustc uses); pulls binutils (as, ld, ar)
#   musl-dev  libc headers, crt files and libc.a for the base image's musl
#   make      build driver for C projects
#   rust      rustc and the standard library for x86_64-alpine-linux-musl
#   cargo     Rust build tool and package manager
gcc
musl-dev
make
rust
cargo
